<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>AI on AI驱动数字化转型</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/tags/ai/</link><description>Recent content in AI on AI驱动数字化转型</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/tags/ai/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>OpenAI 这脚刹车，把AI踩进了下半场</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/openai-%E8%BF%99%E8%84%9A%E5%88%B9%E8%BD%A6%E6%8A%8Aai%E8%B8%A9%E8%BF%9B%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%8B%E5%8D%8A%E5%9C%BA/</link><pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/openai-%E8%BF%99%E8%84%9A%E5%88%B9%E8%BD%A6%E6%8A%8Aai%E8%B8%A9%E8%BF%9B%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%8B%E5%8D%8A%E5%9C%BA/</guid><description>Anthropic 用不到一年把年化营收从 90 亿做到 650 亿美元、头一回录得正利润，OpenAI 却同一天宣布暂缓前沿模型训练。一脚油门一脚刹车，把 AI 下半场的真相踩了出来：安全从成本变入场券，商业模式从卖对话换成卖工作流，资本从买想象变成买回本。</description></item><item><title>你觉得AI记不住东西是个问题？真正的麻烦是它忘不掉、改不动</title><link>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E4%BD%A0%E8%A7%89%E5%BE%97ai%E8%AE%B0%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%8F%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%AA%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E9%BA%BB%E7%83%A6%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%83%E5%BF%98%E4%B8%8D%E6%8E%89%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8/</link><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://zhengjinjun1975.github.io/2026/08/%E4%BD%A0%E8%A7%89%E5%BE%97ai%E8%AE%B0%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%8F%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%E6%98%AF%E4%B8%AA%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E9%BA%BB%E7%83%A6%E6%98%AF%E5%AE%83%E5%BF%98%E4%B8%8D%E6%8E%89%E6%94%B9%E4%B8%8D%E5%8A%A8/</guid><description>AI真正难的不是记不住，而是记住之后改不动、改了带崩一片、连旧的也忘了。记忆的本质不是存储，是把经验压成能改变未来行为的更新方向。</description></item></channel></rss>